NOTE ON THE NEWS IT READS

This licence covers the code. It does not cover the content the app fetches.
JCIAlert reads public RSS feeds and one public index page from Indonesian news
outlets; those headlines and articles remain their publishers' property, and
the app stores and displays them locally for the person running it. It does
not republish them. If you point it at new sources, check their terms.

emiten.json is a registry of IDX ticker symbols and company names, generated
by build_aliases.py. Those are facts about listed companies, not authorship.
